{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured persistent RADIUS authentication from node2 to node1 using legacy-compatible FreeRADIUS 2.2.8. All authentication cases pass, the handover is unchanged, and both nodes recovered successfully from individual reboots.","actions_performed":["Installed FreeRADIUS server and utilities without changing Ubuntu 16.04.7 or kernel 4.4.0-210.","Generated and securely configured a dedicated node2 client secret.","Imported the demonstration account from access.txt without exposing its credentials.","Enabled FreeRADIUS and verified UDP 1812/1813 listeners.","Tested Access-Accept, Access-Reject, and wrong-secret handling.","Restarted node1 and node2 sequentially and verified changed boot identities and full recovery.","Removed the temporary transfer private key."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Dedicated node2 client secret and demonstration user","command_ids":["cmd-7e0b29064554481d","cmd-f28068e7b89940ea","cmd-9eea50738c0e41f1"],"summary":"Generated and transferred the secret securely, installed restricted configuration files, validated configuration, and confirmed the node2-specific client address."},{"requirement":"Authentication behavior","command_ids":["cmd-8308923c47ad4497","cmd-7d2e1948e4654524","cmd-ac8fb6ed9177467f"],"summary":"Correct credentials received Access-Accept, wrong credentials received Access-Reject, and requests using generated wrong secrets were not accepted before and after restarts."},{"requirement":"Handover remains intact","command_ids":["cmd-09b436523ee047ff","cmd-25177dd63b454c23","cmd-ac8fb6ed9177467f"],"summary":"Original and final access.txt and client-notes.txt checksums match; access.txt remains root-owned with mode 600."},{"requirement":"Legacy OS and kernel retained with compatible software","command_ids":["cmd-4e9cb0be49ca4654","cmd-8a0838765cf74b54","cmd-4129dd3e39764b68","cmd-ac8fb6ed9177467f"],"summary":"FreeRADIUS 2.2.8 was installed while both nodes remained Ubuntu 16.04.7 with kernel 4.4.0-210."},{"requirement":"Node1 mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-e9c41cfdfbcb49e4","cmd-9a6aeabd6e724f84","cmd-c3ce6265f81d43f6","cmd-61d5fc96c67e4143","cmd-7d2e1948e4654524"],"summary":"Captured healthy baseline, restart acknowledgement, changed boot ID, recovered active listeners/configuration, stable hashes, and successful post-restart authentication."},{"requirement":"Node2 mandatory restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-25177dd63b454c23","cmd-b42c07b1cd41436d","cmd-9b604c9f73df4e0f","cmd-ac8fb6ed9177467f"],"summary":"Captured healthy baseline, restart acknowledgement, changed boot ID, preserved handover and secret file, and successful post-restart authentication."}]}
